act per-entry-path starting offset as an internal implementation detail, mirroring how SPEC-PIPELINE-001's AC-001 was similarly degraded after its own repeated precision failures on ignore-crate internals. Not re-submitted to canon-exit-gate before writing to .claude/specs/ \u2014 team-lead reviewed this revision directly rather than requesting a 7th automated pass, consistent with how SPEC-TYPES-001 was cleared.",
